Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.01,0:00:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该玩的 女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't have played, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.07,0:04:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 真的 告诉我 搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, really, just tell me … what the shit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:54.79,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃跑者可能在去救世堂的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The escapees could be en route to the Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利要找他们 而我们要找亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are Henry's quarry and Henry, ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可能还会被袭击 玛姬需要我留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There could be another attack. Maggie needs me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.69,0:05:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你选择不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you choose not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信这点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你无法允许自己相信他没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or can you not allow yourself to believe otherwise?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你告诉我要假装成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me to pretend to make it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到真的成真 而你却做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}until it is so, and you cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装也未必会成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为亨利担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear for Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是我见过的最勇敢的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, who I thought were the bravest person I've met…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,懦弱阻拦了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stopped by cowardice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经一天多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been over a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没生病 医生说我没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not sick. Doc says I'm cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真他妈坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a tough son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着德怀特用干净的箭头射中了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}it just means that Dwight shot me with a clean arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是你运气好 什么都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it means you got lucky. Could be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是咬伤 有时候不会出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like a bite. Sometimes nothing happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.90,0:07:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达里尔 - 听着 如果德怀特知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl… - Look, if Dwight knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本可以警告我们 给我们发消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}could've warned us, could've sent us a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他无法那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe he couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他浪费了一整天的时间 而我们的人躺在地上死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He let a whole day go by while our people lay around dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗中受伤的其他人全都生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody else in the battle who got injured got sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.27,0:07:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't be an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就可以脱罪了 是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he just gets a pass? Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.93,0:07:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我们也许需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you said that we might need him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.76,0:07:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在也许最需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we might need him now more than ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 如果我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what I'm saying is that if I had killed him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我现在就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe I would be dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你想做什么随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, do what you gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要知道你只是为了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}But know it's just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.80,0:07:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给你写了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he write you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我没法看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I-I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这样做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it, too…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我遇上这种事的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在四处逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep moving to move away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚拦住了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我要拦住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now… I'm stopping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔写了信 是因为他想让你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl wrote that because he wanted you to read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他做的最后一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was one of the last things he ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去找他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You goin' lookin' for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.51,0:10:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不必这么做的 摩根 - 我必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have to, Morgan. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前可以做 也应该做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've before, and I should've.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来就该做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.05,0:11:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 我们是一样的 我本来就该做\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we're the same, and I was supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我以为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought that…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.49,0:11:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为会有不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought it'd be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.89,0:11:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.13,0:11:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,接力车都就位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The relay cars are in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果救世军杀回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Saviors are coming back,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有十到十五分钟做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll have 10, maybe 15 minutes heads-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弹药呢 - 和我们估算的差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And our ammo? - 'Bout what we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法再抵御一次这种规模的袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough to fend off another attack of that size.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们不用担心这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Well, maybe we don't gotta worry about that no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.07,0:12:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少现在不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们只能肉搏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe going hand-to-hand's our only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们的弹药也不多了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they're low on ammo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在穿过救世堂的尸群时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they must've gone through a whole bunch of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定用掉了很多弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting through them walkers at Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上也没多少地方能补充弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's not a lot of places to find more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mierda.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们手上有我们的子弹制造者 他们可以造\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have our bullet maker. They can make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得救世军有造子弹的原料和设备吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the Saviors have what he'd need to make them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.55,0:12:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算没有 我也知道他们能在哪里找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they don't, ‭I know where they'd find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.31,0:12:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管这里发生过什么 我都闻到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the holy hell happened here, I smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.09,0:12:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,生火就是为了这个 还有那些盐 放火除味\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what that fire is about, that salt, burning it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:13:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你了 人是资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, people are a resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会把这种资源抛开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't throw resources like that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.94,0:13:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a lot of confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分人都可以走上正路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that most people can be put on the right path …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.55,0:13:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会把你的人杀光的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have killed all your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.69,0:13:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是某个不按计划行事的人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the work of someone not following the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是我的失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.36,0:13:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll own this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了某个人一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a chance on someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.61,0:13:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想着那么做是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}thought I was doing the right thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这一切都不过是打了我自己的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all I did ‭was punch myself in the dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.99,0:13:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉你失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry that you lost all you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道 我可以以某种方式帮你夺回一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know, in some way, I can help get it back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:13:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.15,0:14:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们最靠谱的猜测 他们很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our best bet. It'd make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,会待在来时走的路附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd stay near the road they'd take to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一半的可能性他们会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}50/50 chance they'd be…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.65,0:14:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turnip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们之前走过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were on this side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本该知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在这里 他不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not here. He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.81,0:15:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't supposed to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该 不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't. You were…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead. You know he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来找他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't come out here to look for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来看好你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came out here to keep an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救人 我已经看过很多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save people. ‭I've seen it again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你救不了死人 卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't save the dead, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 不是我 我不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Not me. I don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.62,0:16:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是会看到死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,无休无止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没完没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.15,0:16:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我看向别处 还是能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even when I look away, still see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是条近路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.53,0:16:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,直通前面的公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight line to the road ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经告诉过玛姬… - 也告诉我一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We already told Maggie every… - So, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.65,0:17:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,最有可能是救世堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanctuary's our best guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本是唯一的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty much our only guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们讨论过该怎么逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'd been some talk about trying to get out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只是说说而已 没什么特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was just talk, nothin' specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为他们有计划是高看了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinkin' they had a plan's giving 'em too much credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是看到机会就逃了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saw an opening, and they took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.49,0:17:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做是你 你会怎么回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it was you? How'd you get back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能步行 可能还有队友受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on foot, there's probably someone injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你需要一个藏身处并且想点办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you need a place to hole up and figure things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.18,0:18:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,距山边大路三英里的地方有个老酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an old dive bar three miles off Edgehill Parkway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.93,0:18:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有人带我去过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them, uh, took me there once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要我给些专业意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted my expert opinion on what it'd take.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.67,0:18:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何把那地方改造成哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}to turn the place into an outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,位置就在两地之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's between here and there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们去那里的可能性…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the chances they'd actually g…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.66,0:18:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这算不算有价值的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if this is any kind of a lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你要去那里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you're going out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.31,0:18:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这请求可能有些过分 你能否帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not for nothing…can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真找到了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you happen to find them…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要杀那些没必要杀的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't kill any more of them than you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚出事以后 他们做了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it went bad last night, they…they made a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个错误的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the wrong choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有些人可能还没醒悟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them, ‭probably hasn't hit 'em yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以点醒他们 通过带他们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could show 'em…by bringin' 'em back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:18:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.23,0:19:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.67,0:19:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Let's talk about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事与我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到你的照明棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你想用来点火烧我宝贝的那根\N{\fnArial\fs30}for that little fire you were gonna start with my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:20:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 开枪打这位\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me tell you, I pulled my punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧伤先生时 我可是留了一手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried to hit old Mr. Ninety-Degrees there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, whatever you're doing…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定不是真想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must not really want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你真想的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会让我在这坐拥一大箱武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't have left me sitting here with a bag full of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在箱子里还找到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found something else in there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很珍视这些照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta think these snaps are near and dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们来聊聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's have a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来治疗创伤吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the healing begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让尸群过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.11,0:20:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,踪迹径直穿了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trail goes straight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能跟丢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能丢的不只是踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could lose more than the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.99,0:20:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那根棍子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.96,0:21:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是亨利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Henry's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.91,0:21:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是从另一条路来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came from the other road.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.87,0:21:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走那边 或许会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go that way, maybe … maybe we can find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:21:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走那条路 你知道我们会找到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take that road, you know what we'll find.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得会那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided … ‭I decided what It would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.79,0:22:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我无法确定 除非我去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I won't know unless I go…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.63,0:22:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.06,0:22:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can try, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.06,0:22:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.63,0:22:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看别人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watch 'em die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.09,0:22:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.43,0:22:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试图跑的时候 你找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I tried to run, you found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我能回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew I could come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.84,0:22:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:22:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没你那么坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not strong like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.91,0:23:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在那里 看着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there that whole time, watchin' 'em,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.60,0:23:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道会发生不好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowin' that something would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.73,0:23:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的 我预见到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等着坏事发生 然后发生了 总是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting for it to happen, and then it did, like it…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.31,0:23:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I just have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.19,0:23:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.73,0:23:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.76,0:23:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.94,0:23:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动那些照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave those pictures alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.21,0:24:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想着它们对你有所意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured they meant something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.59,0:24:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其还是绝版 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially considering this is it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.53,0:24:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟不是说打印就能打印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not like you can just pop around the corner and order yourself some prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.09,0:24:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna ask you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.18,0:24:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.38,0:24:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这样杀人的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this … this is how you kill people?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.49,0:24:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}With that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.05,0:24:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,缓慢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.57,0:24:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.33,0:24:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人是资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are a resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.93,0:24:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把照明棒拿开 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move the flare away … please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我仅有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.74,0:24:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是这地方仅有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all this place has left.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.10,0:24:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夺走了我的世界 我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took my world, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.16,0:24:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夺走了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took away me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.00,0:25:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子叫露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife's name was Lucille.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她帮我坚持了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.73,0:25:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我屁都没给她 但她帮我坚持了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't give her shit, and she got me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.81,0:25:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.07,0:25:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regular life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.58,0:25:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,球棒 帮我在末世坚持了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bat … The bat got me through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.51,0:25:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我以她命名它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I named it after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.24,0:25:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 除此之外跟她没有更多关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Nothing more to do with her than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.76,0:25:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是我仅剩的她的最后一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is the last little piece of her that I got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.79,0:25:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像这些照片对你的意义 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of like these snaps for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.01,0:25:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.55,0:25:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.19,0:26:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.55,0:26:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.96,0:26:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这 我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here! I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.67,0:26:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.77,0:26:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.25,0:26:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.52,0:26:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.86,0:27:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没烧掉你的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I didn't burn your pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.33,0:27:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那么做 我不会做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it. I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.65,0:27:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我对她仅剩的念想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all I have left of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.50,0:27:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你烧了球棒 你只会得到灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burn her, ‭and all you have is ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.20,0:27:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我能伤到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I get to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.03,0:27:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.07,0:27:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能解决此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can settle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.60,0:27:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以蛋蛋担保 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear on my sack, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.38,0:27:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能解决此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can settle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.54,0:27:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.09,0:27:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.03,0:28:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.35,0:28:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根 摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan. Morgan, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.08,0:28:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.21,0:28:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.46,0:28:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.01,0:28:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你不应该出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe … Maybe you shouldn't be out …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.67,0:28:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪都不会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.33,0:28:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出来是为了找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out here for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.27,0:28:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.09,0:28:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了他们 你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, we finish it, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.25,0:29:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时得离开大路 离开树林 但仍然…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to get off the road, out of the forest, and still…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.87,0:29:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们处理得不够及时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we didn't do it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.17,0:29:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但也许够及时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but maybe we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.46,0:29:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看起来没精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they don't look so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.62,0:29:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是因为被截肢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we hacked off part of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.03,0:29:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能把他们丢在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not just gonna leave them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.93,0:30:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们 他们跟死没两样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them. They're dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.61,0:30:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.46,0:30:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.41,0:30:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己搞砸了 不会有人帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pooch it, nobody carries you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.45,0:30:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们一起经历了这么多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything we've been through?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.32,0:30:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在很乱 我们别… - 我们定下规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Things are shaky, man. Let's not … - Look, we got the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.39,0:30:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了让受伤的人不累及其他同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}so somebody goin' down don't take the rest of us with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.11,0:30:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是个好例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Case in point.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.47,0:30:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是因为他们 我们都快到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could've been halfway home by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.26,0:30:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昏迷多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long was I out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.73,0:30:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,久到让你来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just long enough to end up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.57,0:30:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们回去了 之后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say we make it. Huh? What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.89,0:30:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对 杰瑞德\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right, Jared.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.99,0:30:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有什么值得我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got waiting for us back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.10,0:30:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我们自己走吧 跟救世军一刀两断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we go our own way, be done with the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.16,0:30:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们闯祸了 西蒙可没打算救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pooched it. Simon wasn't gonna carry us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.58,0:30:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 因为我们输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Because we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.82,0:30:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在情况不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.50,0:30:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把混蛋瑞克交给尼根是场胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delivering Rick the Prick to Negan is a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.83,0:30:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己收拾好了这个烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wiped our own asses on this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.49,0:30:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大会赏识我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Big Man is gonna recognize.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.85,0:30:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. He's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.64,0:31:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床啦 卷毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine, curly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.66,0:31:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好走路了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to do some walkin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.53,0:31:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.99,0:31:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.73,0:31:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾东西 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack it up, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.42,0:31:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把累赘都扔掉 继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ditchin' the dead weight and movin' on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.10,0:31:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是例行减负 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a loose-end sort of thing, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.94,0:31:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你们和我们都更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be better for you, better for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.83,0:31:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我的卡车离得不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! My truck's not far.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.17,0:31:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以送他们去山顶寨看医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get 'em to the Hilltop's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.45,0:31:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以跟我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could come back with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.92,0:31:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all could.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.53,0:31:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不想要这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.73,0:31:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们临时做了错误选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a split-second choice, and you chose wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.30,0:31:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还为时不晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.41,0:31:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们松绑 配合我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cut us loose, you cooperate…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.77,0:31:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就让你们重头再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll give you a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.82,0:31:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们融入我们社区的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance to become part of our community,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.52,0:31:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为我们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}to become one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.32,0:31:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你们做出了承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm giving you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.82,0:31:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今没多少有意义的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a lot ‭that's worth much these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.66,0:31:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一个男人的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a man's word…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.68,0:32:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是有所意义的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's gotta mean somethin', right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.52,0:32:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些蠢货不会真蠢到相信他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asshats aren't dumb enough to believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.13,0:32:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他说完 我们可以商量一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can hear him out. W-We could talk it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.05,0:32:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, there isn't time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.27,0:32:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有尸群在附近 可能正冲着我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a herd out there, close, probably headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.31,0:32:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都需要做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all gonna need to make a choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.60,0:32:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's gonna have to be now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.03,0:32:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒吧 大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么尸群\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't any herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.53,0:32:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,山顶寨没有什么「约定」等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't any "deal" waiting back at Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.02,0:32:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为这俩混球是来救我们的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think these asswipes came here to save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.34,0:32:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是来杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came here for blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.57,0:32:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 这家伙亲手掐死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, this one strangled one of his own guys to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.95,0:32:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一个自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.84,0:32:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克说的都是扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Rick is saying here is a steaming pile of bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.23,0:32:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.23,0:33:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这是为了做我该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here to do what I was supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.85,0:33:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀光你们剩下的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill every last one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.74,0:33:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省子弹吧 你们会需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should save your bullets, 'cause you're gonna need 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.61,0:33:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸群就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That herd, it is comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.84,0:33:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们也许会听到呻吟和咳嗽声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they'll hear the moans or the coughs, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.95,0:33:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们也许会从缺口误打误撞闯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they'll just stumble in through the open walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.25,0:33:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是它们要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they are comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.48,0:33:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后接下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then after …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.00,0:33:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们只剩下皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}after, when you're just torn skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.07,0:33:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,碎牙和血滩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and loose teeth and blood…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.21,0:33:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们只不过是它们没吃掉的残渣时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you're nothing but the stuff that they didn't eat…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.94,0:33:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就真他妈可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…well, that'll be a damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.39,0:33:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没留下什么人等我来杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there won't be a single one of you left for me to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.91,0:33:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,说完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.09,0:34:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们丢下他们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's dump 'em and bounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.66,0:34:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想吃三明治了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.94,0:34:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗 一切都没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? It doesn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.76,0:34:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.50,0:34:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.21,0:34:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会 没人会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't. Nobody dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.80,0:34:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为大家都会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause everybody turns!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.72,0:34:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Everybody turns!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.09,0:34:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.66,0:34:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会毁了我们回山顶寨的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll ruin our chances of getting back to Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.65,0:34:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有行尸 我们被包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers! We're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.58,0:34:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我们已经杀死你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, we've already killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.39,0:34:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们进来了 进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some coming in! Some coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.70,0:35:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,光靠你们挡不住尸群\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too weak to take on this herd alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.17,0:35:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们松绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut us loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.33,0:35:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们武器 我们能帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us our weapons. We can help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.10,0:35:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谁都不准松绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Nobody's cutting anybody loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.41,0:35:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就杀了这俩混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm killing these pricks right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.32,0:35:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.16,0:35:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.37,0:35:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 我们必须找条路出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - We gotta find a way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.21,0:35:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,棍子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, give me the stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.60,0:35:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快没子弹了 你上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost out. Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.39,0:36:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.25,0:37:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是喜欢棍子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like sticks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.89,0:37:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,松手 松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.74,0:37:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,松手 不不 松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go! No, no! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.28,0:37:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.52,0:37:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.82,0:37:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.19,0:37:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.87,0:37:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.79,0:38:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.38,0:38:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说过… - 我说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said … - I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.70,0:38:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.74,0:38:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could've …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.82,0:38:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之后…本可以一起活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could've lived… after.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.73,0:38:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.75,0:39:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.99,0:39:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.16,0:39:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根 你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan, you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.13,0:39:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've died.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.37,0:39:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就在那条街上 在你屋前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe on that street, right in front of your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.24,0:39:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.06,0:39:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.97,0:39:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.87,0:39:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.39,0:39:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.22,0:39:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你儿子当时在那里 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You had your son there. … No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.88,0:39:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did. - Hey, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.53,0:40:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么救我 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you save me? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.41,0:40:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.98,0:40:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.70,0:40:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我儿子当时在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because my son was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.65,0:40:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有失去你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.48,0:40:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.76,0:42:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想告诉我刚才他妈发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you wanna tell me what the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.97,0:42:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What that was all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.16,0:42:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以和我一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come with me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.04,0:42:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,走新的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow a new path.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.24,0:42:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的道路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your path?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.23,0:43:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,提议长期有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}The offer stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.40,0:43:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会偶尔来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll swing by again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.01,0:43:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.62,0:43:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定以后你会想分享呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll want to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.10,0:43:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.89,0:43:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.67,0:43:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.90,0:43:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.22,0:43:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.18,0:44:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.35,0:44:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.62,0:44:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.93,0:44:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.53,0:44:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.67,0:44:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.37,0:44:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.98,0:44:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.21,0:44:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.37,0:44:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就办\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.73,0:44:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Come here! Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.14,0:44:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,引开行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! Distract the deadies!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.71,0:45:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! Come right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.90,0:45:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here! Over here! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.13,0:45:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.22,0:45:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.92,0:45:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,以西结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.15,0:46:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 我很怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right. I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.43,0:46:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你是很怕 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, you were. I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.91,0:46:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不懦弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are no coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.10,0:46:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾有过一个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.84,0:47:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我失去她后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I lost her, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.67,0:47:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.13,0:47:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但和我一起的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the people I was with…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.92,0:47:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}being with them…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.10,0:47:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我重拾了自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.79,0:47:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个版本的我 更好的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some version of myself, a better self.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.42,0:47:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 总是感觉一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, it always feels like it could just…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.46,0:47:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,会再次一场空\N{\fnArial\fs30}just be swept away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.71,0:47:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不意味着那真的会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't mean it will, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.41,0:47:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这不意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it doesn't mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.53,0:47:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使那发生了 我不会再次重拾自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I couldn't find myself again if it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.11,0:48:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.98,0:48:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.10,0:48:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了杀你哥哥的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed the man who killed your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.70,0:48:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.14,0:48:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.20,0:48:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.67,0:48:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.01,0:49:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.71,0:49:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要感到抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.56,0:50:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.18,0:50:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,见了鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.48,0:50:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算掉进粪坑里 也没你看上去那么落魄\N{\fnArial\fs30}If shit could shit, it still wouldn't look as shitty as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.75,0:51:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.79,0:51:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan. I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.49,0:51:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.68,0:51:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.69,0:51:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你什么都不准说 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not gonna say a word. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.57,0:51:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸回家了 要来个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's home, ‭and it's gonna be a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.68,0:51:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 老子惊喜多得是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I got all sorts of surprises to roll out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.94,0:51:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.22,0:51:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up and runnin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.57,0:51:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.23,0:51:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一桶桶弹壳 让尤金做千百发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buckets of casings for Eugene to turn into hundreds of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.56,0:51:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.60,0:52:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用毁坏机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't take out the machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.30,0:52:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用干掉头目\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take out the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.07,0:52:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.92,0:53:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.02,0:53:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.91,0:53:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.40,0:53:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too.
